docs/features/intelligent-sourcing/DESIGN-STATUS.md-65-
docs/features/intelligent-sourcing/DESIGN-STATUS.md-66-**Technical (authoritative)** вЂ” one check per requirement the item has: supplierStatus (BLOCKED => FAIL), process,
docs/features/intelligent-sourcing/DESIGN-STATUS.md-67-material, toleranceClass (ordinal coarse<medium<fine<precision), maxDimensionMm, certifications, capacity vs quantity.
docs/features/intelligent-sourcing/DESIGN-STATUS.md-68-No capability data => UNKNOWN (never PASS, never FAIL). Any FAIL => `technicalStatus = FAIL`.
docs/features/intelligent-sourcing/DESIGN-STATUS.md-69-
docs/features/intelligent-sourcing/DESIGN-STATUS.md-70-**Scores 0-100 (only meaningful for PASS/UNKNOWN; FAIL gets `overallScore = null`)**
docs/features/intelligent-sourcing/DESIGN-STATUS.md-71-- commercial = 100 Г— cheapest price among *technically not failed* candidates / own price. Price source: quote break
docs/features/intelligent-sourcing/DESIGN-STATUS.md-72-  for the quantity в†’ own latest purchase в†’ similar-item purchase (`priceSource` says which).
docs/features/intelligent-sourcing/DESIGN-STATUS.md-73-- delivery: lead time (capability в†’ history average) vs days available; lead > available => 0 + `deliveryRisk: LATE`;
docs/features/intelligent-sourcing/DESIGN-STATUS.md-74-  в‰¤50 % of the window = 100, linear in between; blended 70/30 with the on-time rate when history exists.
docs/features/intelligent-sourcing/DESIGN-STATUS.md-75-- quality: defect rate over own purchases (10 % rejects = 0); newest two vs earlier => `qualityTrend WORSENING` (в€’20).
docs/features/intelligent-sourcing/DESIGN-STATUS.md:76:- history: 40 + 20 Г— own purchases + 15 Г— ОЈ similarityScore of similar-item purchases; none => `null`.
docs/features/intelligent-sourcing/DESIGN-STATUS.md-77-- overall = weighted average (commercial .35, delivery .30, quality .20, history .15) **over the scores that exist**;
docs/features/intelligent-sourcing/DESIGN-STATUS.md-78-  missing scores are excluded, never guessed. `dataCompleteness` = weight sum; `confidence` low/medium/high from it.
docs/features/intelligent-sourcing/DESIGN-STATUS.md-79-
docs/features/intelligent-sourcing/DESIGN-STATUS.md-80-**Ranking**: PASS в†’ UNKNOWN в†’ FAIL; within a group overall desc, then data completeness, then price, then id.
docs/features/intelligent-sourcing/DESIGN-STATUS.md-81-`recommendedSupplierId` = first PASS with an overall score.
docs/features/intelligent-sourcing/DESIGN-STATUS.md-82-
